<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>365 Days of Us ❤️</title>

<style>
body{
margin:0;
padding:0;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000000,#1b001b);
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
height:100vh;
overflow:hidden;
color:white;
text-align:center;
}

.container{
animation:fade 1.5s ease;
padding:20px;
}

h1{
font-size:50px;
color:#ff4d9d;
text-shadow:0 0 15px #ff4d9d;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

p{
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.6;
}

button{
margin-top:30px;
padding:15px 35px;
font-size:20px;
border:none;
border-radius:40px;
background:#ff4d9d;
color:white;
cursor:pointer;
transition:0.3s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
box-shadow:0 0 20px #ff4d9d;
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);}
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>❤️ 365 Days Of Us ❤️</h1>

<p>
Welcome to our first anniversary journey... 💖
</p>

<p>
✨ One Year. Endless Memories. Forever To Go. ✨
</p>

<button onclick="alert('Happy 1st Anniversary My Love ❤️')">
Start Our Journey
</button>

</div>

</body>
</html>
